ginally a clay pot that broke someone's skull, itself undamaged. The dinner table has always been a place for squabbles. Tables are flipped and pots are broken, but in the end, everyone might still have to sit back down and eat together.","abilities":["Can use long-ranged weapons to attack <Sapidity>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":500,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"bloated":{"slug":"bloated","name":"'Bloated'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Bloated'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Originally a hardened vessel for holding the five grains. The five grains are fundamental to sating hunger, and the vessel that stores them must not only be solid and heavy, but also exceptionally tough.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":7500,"atk":800,"def":4000,"res":90,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"drifting_aroma":{"slug":"drifting_aroma","name":"Drifting Aroma","icon":"/enemies-icons/Drifting Aroma.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the influence of a Sui Proxy. Boil chili and pepper in the pot, add some burdenbeast tallow, and let the aroma drift across town. Do not be too hasty when you tuck in, lest the heat burn your mouth.","abilities":["Continuously inflicts Arts damage and Burn to its surroundings","Immune to Slow"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":200,"def":325,"res":60,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"prosperity":{"slug":"prosperity","name":"Prosperity","icon":"/enemies-icons/Prosperity.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of the people's longing for a better life. Approach it carelessly, and gold coins will come at you in a way that you did not bargain for.","abilities":["Spits gold coins to deal heavy damage at long range; Uses only melee attacks when out of coins","Can absorb nearby <Vapidity> or <Sapidity> to regain 1 gold coin"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":1600,"def":1000,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"gluttony":{"slug":"gluttony","name":"Gluttony","icon":"/enemies-icons/Gluttony.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Abomination born from the heart of the Sui proxy, awakened from dream, devouring disappointment. There is taste in reunion, as there is in remembrance. There is taste in joy, as there is in sorrow. There is taste in pride, as there is in regret.","abilities":["[Metal Constitution] Takes reduced Physical and Arts damage. Effect temporarily disabled after taking damage from <Sapid Auspice>. When in Glutton form, the effect is increased, and the effect downtime is shortened","[Open Invitation] Absorbs all nearby <Sapidity> and <Vapidity> to increase its own SP","[Boundless Greed] When SP is at max, summons <Vapid Blight>, dealing True damage to all allied units","Wrath of Hunger","[Raid and Plunder] Spits acid at 1 allied unit within range; all allied units in the acidic area take continuous Arts damage","[Insatiable Desire] Summons additional <Vapidity>; effect increases in Glutton form","[Greed] When HP drops to 0, summons a large number of <Vapidity>, and transforms into Glutton form after some time","Glutton","Gains increased ATK, ASPD, and DEF; attacks become ranged","[Hoarding Avarice] Transforms all <Sapidity> to <Vapidity>, and periodically pulls all <Vapidity> towards itself; while skill is active, becomes immune to control effects, and absorbing <Vapidity> restores HP","[Devour Terrain] Summons <Mouth of Annihilation> and <Mouth of Creation>"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.45,"stats":{"hp":80000,"atk":1500,"def":700,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":4}},"sapid_auspice":{"slug":"sapid_auspice","name":"'Sapid Auspice'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Sapid Auspice'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of a convergence of Sapidity. Likes to hover over places where many gather, an auspicious symbol that drives out illness and keeps disaster away.","abilities":["Deals True damage to all enemy units in its path","Cannot be attacked, does not count towards the defeated enemies counter, will not deplete Life Points on leaving the field"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":3,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":8000,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.6}},"vapid_blight":{"slug":"vapid_blight","name":"'Vapid Blight'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Vapid Blight'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Abomination born of a convergence of Vapidity. Likes to hover over places that are barren and broken, a symbol of misfortune.","abilities":["Deals True damage to all allied units in its path","Cannot be attacked, does not count towards the defeated enemies counter, will not deplete Life Points on leaving the field"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":3,"stats":{"hp":100,"atk":1500,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.6}},"mouth_of_annihilation":{